			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/7fcc0f3b9a0d4b1941b1d023.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/ecb9e7f7b3e00803e6e4a9ec.png width:240 height:120 align:center}"
				"4甲壳＋4幻翼膜＋1回响碎片。"
				"按工作台合成。"
				"监守者装备的升级材料。"
				"模板从古城来源取得，下界合金基础装备另行准备。"
