					advancement: "deeperdarker:main/enter_otherside"
					criterion: ""
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/e622e62e54d3e0d3c1a177fc.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"深渊之心＋有效OthersidePortalShape。在主世界/幽冥使用。"
				"清理框架内遮挡并右击内侧。WardenHeartItem成功后清空该手物品，不是可使用工具。"
				"进入幽冥。"
				"另取第二颗心才做法杖。返回门/返程路线先记。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "4201ACDEBB816D41"
			title: "在幽冥取得幽匿骨头"
