			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/5c34d44eb0f8a28162e9cf3a.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/e4cd69d0ae13ecfe49978668.png width:240 height:120 align:center}"
				"原版鞘翅＋灵魂水晶＋灵魂粉尘＋幽匿骨头。"
				"按合成制作。这条路线真实涉及原版末地鞘翅来源，但不新造屠龙完成锁。"
				"具特色机动的鞘翅。"
				"可选装备不锁古城/门户初次探索。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "081E19C65EED0173"
			title: "Resonarium板材与铁装升级"
			icon: "deeperdarker:resonarium_plate"
