				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/47f18331aa47528b39a1482a.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/e700bf17c9b86173e94c246e.png width:240 height:120 align:center}"
				"4Resonarium＋4鳞甲。"
				"合板后查铁装的smithing升级配方。英文资源确实存在。"
				"并行过渡装备路线。"
				"这条材料路线与监守者装备可分别发展。"
			]
		}
